  "experiment": {
    "claim": "README.md 'Target specification (ratified -- see DR-005, issue #1)' row 'Startup time' (< 1 ms), for the 3.3 V primary flavor (DR-001). Ramps the supply feeding design/bandgap_core.sch from 0 V to the corner supply in t_ramp and measures the first time VREF rises through 1.08 V (90% of the 1.20 V ratified nominal), open-circuit, over the full 45-point PVT matrix. NOTE: the core cell as merged by #8 contains no startup injector -- GDRV is exposed as the attachment node and the injector is issue #10's deliverable -- so this bench measures the core AS COMMITTED. A failure here is a statement about the missing injector, not about the bench.",
